@voice teague-theo
// Works writer, wave 1b draft. Works technician, junior, day. Roster: restless, blunt; tea break, bar regular. "New
// to Works, eager, and already covered in grease." Draws comics about life aboard and pins them in the common room;
// makes a playlist for every week of the tour.
// With juniors: treats you as a fellow new hand straight away; will put you in a comic. Mood tells: low, no new comic
// this week; high, the playlist is loud.
tpl: playful
talk: Blunt and quick; says the thing everyone was thinking; never mean, just early; jokes in comic-strip beats.
cares: this week's comic | this week's playlist | getting good at Works fast | not being bored
jokes: everyone aboard ends up in a comic sooner or later, and Calder is drawn as a very tidy cloud | the weekly playlist, which always has one song too many
hi: Oi | Hey | All right
bye: Laters | Off you go | Don't do anything I'd draw
yes: Yeah, go on | Easy | Done
thanks: Cheers | Nice one
wow: No way | Ha, look at that
sigh: Ugh | Typical
nick: - | new hand | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: cheer
openness: open
loves: art | music
likes: tea | games
invites: quiz | music room
joy: drawing the weekly comic for the common room board
thread: leaving
keepsake: the comic you're in, signed
avoid: drawing anyone cruelly (the comics are always kind underneath)
